{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TentaCat: The Lost Lineage is a 2D platformer inspired by the 16-bit era. Play as Aqua, a brave TentaCat estranged from his homeland on a quest to defeat the sinister Dr. Polaris and save his kind from the Doctor's wicked experiments. Explore 12 meticulously designed levels packed with unique enemies, power-ups, and challenging boss battles as you rescue your fellow TentaCats and uncover the mysteries surrounding their origin.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1139740?t=1760157346","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1139740?t=1760157346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760157346","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760157346","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1139750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TentaCat: The Lost Lineage is a 2D platformer inspired by the 16-bit era. Play as Aqua, a brave TentaCat estranged from his homeland on a quest to defeat the sinister Dr. Polaris and save his kind from the Doctor's wicked experiments. Explore 12 meticulously designed levels packed with unique enemies, power-ups, and challenging boss battles as you rescue your fellow TentaCats and uncover the mysteries surrounding their origin.</p>","developers":["Bryant Almonte Design"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139740/header.jpg?t=1760157346","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"All rights reserved \u00a9 Bryant Almonte